# Design system (WebApp)

Full reference: [`docs/design-system.md`](../docs/design-system.md). Implementation: `src/WebApp/wwwroot/app.css`.

**Responsive:** shell at **641px**; global content width **`--app-page-max`** (fluid clamp in `app.css`); avoid extra viewport breakpoints unless local layout needs them (`--app-bp-lg` = 992px for split settings editor).

**List rows:** nav (`NavLink`) vs `ui-list-row-rich` vs `ui-group-row-static` — different hover/active; see `docs/design-system.md` § List row interaction.

## Non‑negotiables

- **No new UI libraries.** Use `ui-*` / `app-page-*` primitives and CSS variables.
- **No raw colors in component CSS** for theme surfaces/text (use `--app-*` / `--ui-*`).
- **No `::deep` in `app.css`** — only in scoped `*.razor.css`.
- **Focus:** `--app-focus-ring-shadow` (2px ring), not ad‑hoc `color-mix` rings.
- **Elevation:** `--app-elev-1` (chrome/cards) → `--app-elev-2` (menus/composer focus) → `--app-elev-3` (modals/drawer). Shadow containers, not rows.
- **Glass:** use `--app-glass-blur-chrome|panel|float` + `--app-glass-scrim` / `--app-glass-highlight`; shell shows `--app-main-gradient` through panels.

## Markup shortcuts

| Need | Use |
|------|-----|
| Page (dashboard, settings) | `app-page` → `app-page-header` + `app-page-body` / `app-page-body-inner` |
| Settings chrome | `SettingsShell` + `settings-card` / `settings-input` (shell CSS) |
| Provider/account editor form | `settings-provider-editor-form` + `SettingsEditorHost` CSS — see docs § Settings-only |
| Primary/secondary/danger action | `ui-btn` + `ui-btn-primary` / `-secondary` / `-danger` |
| Settings-style list | `ui-group` + `ui-group-row` (+ title/desc/chevron) |
| Tabs / Dark–Light | `ui-segmented` + `ui-segmented-btn` + `ui-segmented-btn-active` |
| Empty / status | `ui-empty-state`, `ui-status-pill` |
| Menu | `ui-dropdown-menu` + `ui-dropdown-option` |

Bootstrap classes are for legacy form reboot only — not product buttons/cards.

## CSS placement

1. Token or reusable pattern → `app.css`
2. One page layout → `{Page}.razor.css`
3. Settings forms → `SettingsShell.razor.css` with `::deep` as needed

Match existing motion: `--ui-duration*`, `--ui-ease-out` for enter; honor `prefers-reduced-motion`.

## Theme

Dark default on `:root`; light via `[data-theme="light"]`. New semantic tokens → **both** theme blocks. Navbar + Appearance stay in sync via `app-theme-changed` in `webapp.js`.
